# Trim Playwright weight that this bundle never exercises. The server only does
# chromium.launch() -> newContext -> page.goto / fill / click -> context.cookies()
# for the Entra ID SSO handshake; the trace viewer / HTML reporter / codegen
# recorder UI and the Android / Electron drivers are all unused. Kept deliberately
# conservative: license texts, .d.ts files, and the CDP/BiDi transport stay
# (chromium.launch() can route through the latter depending on channel).
node_modules/playwright-core/lib/vite/
node_modules/playwright-core/lib/server/android/
node_modules/playwright-core/lib/server/electron/
node_modules/**/*.js.map

**/.DS_Store
